IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SCISSORHANDS-KV.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOTAL-TOKENS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 BUDGET-RATIO-PCT    PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 PERSISTENT-TOKENS   PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SCISSORHANDS.
    IF TOTAL-TOKENS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF BUDGET-RATIO-PCT == 0
        MOVE 35 TO BUDGET-RATIO-PCT.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE PERSISTENT-TOKENS = (TOTAL-TOKENS * BUDGET-RATIO-PCT) / 100.
    IF PERSISTENT-TOKENS == 0
        MOVE 1 TO PERSISTENT-TOKENS.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 PERSISTENT-TOKENS.
    WEIGHT 30 BUDGET-RATIO-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
